{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13545","headline":"题女道士居 · 秦系","name":"题女道士居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不饵住云溪，休丹罢药畦。\n杏花虚结子，石髓任成泥。\n扫地青牛卧，栽松白鹤栖。\n共知仙女丽，莫是阮郎妻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}